#showas:来自过去的冲击
A chance to claim the Exodian Blade, but better than before.

This is on a "realistic" and "rectangular" map type, with 85 planets. 

You have a random starting fleet and a random starting support fleet.
You also have more cryogenic pods and home settlements in your home planet than normal.

You are against two Difficulty 7 AI's, one of them is Random Any and the other one is Adaptive Any. There are also 5 Risk Analyzers and Intensity 5 Astro Trains.

Since there isn't enough space for the tooltips to display, I have to summarize things, and the rest will be a surprise to you.
This has the potential to become a pretty hardcore mission, as it has Ironman, Doomsday and Permadeath for Officers modes on. Periodic AIP is enabled. Enhanced Overlord and Showdown Devices are enabled. Also quite a few Expert+ settings are enabled. You lose Hacking Points for crippled units. Distributed Resource Generation and Fuel are enabled. You can win the mission only if there are no hostiles present in your homeworld.

Factions:
Intensity 5 Splintering Spire
Intensity 5 Zenith Dyson Sphere
Intensity 5 Fallen Spire, with an option to claim the Exodian Blade
Zenith Trader
Reclaimers
Uncommon Points of Interest